# 部署和运维规则

## 容器化规范

### Docker 最佳实践
- 使用多阶段构建优化镜像大小
- 使用非 root 用户运行容器
- 使用健康检查确保服务可用性
- 使用 .dockerignore 排除不必要的文件

### Dockerfile 规范
```dockerfile
# 多阶段构建示例
FROM node:20-alpine AS builder

WORKDIR /app
COPY package*.json ./
RUN npm ci --only=production

FROM node:20-alpine AS runtime

# 创建非 root 用户
RUN addgroup -g 1001 -S nodejs
RUN adduser -S nextjs -u 1001

WORKDIR /app

# 复制构建产物
COPY --from=builder --chown=nextjs:nodejs /app/node_modules ./node_modules
COPY --chown=nextjs:nodejs . .

# 健康检查
HEALTHCHECK --interval=30s --timeout=3s --start-period=5s --retries=3 \
  CMD curl -f http://localhost:3000/health || exit 1

USER nextjs

EXPOSE 3000

CMD ["npm", "start"]
```

### Docker Compose 规范
```yaml
# docker-compose.yml 示例
version: '3.8'

services:
  bytebot-ui:
    build: ./packages/bytebot-ui
    ports:
      - "3000:3000"
    environment:
      - NODE_ENV=production
      - DATABASE_URL=${DATABASE_URL}
    depends_on:
      - bytebot-agent
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD", "curl", "-f", "http://localhost:3000/health"]
      interval: 30s
      timeout: 10s
      retries: 3

  bytebot-agent:
    build: ./packages/bytebot-agent
    ports:
      - "9991:9991"
    environment:
      - NODE_ENV=production
      - DATABASE_URL=${DATABASE_URL}
    depends_on:
      - postgres
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD", "curl", "-f", "http://localhost:9991/health"]
      interval: 30s
      timeout: 10s
      retries: 3

  postgres:
    image: postgres:15-alpine
    environment:
      - POSTGRES_DB=${POSTGRES_DB}
      - POSTGRES_USER=${POSTGRES_USER}
      - POSTGRES_PASSWORD=${POSTGRES_PASSWORD}
    volumes:
      - postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD-SHELL", "pg_isready -U ${POSTGRES_USER}"]
      interval: 30s
      timeout: 10s
      retries: 3

volumes:
  postgres_data:
```

## Kubernetes 部署

### Helm Chart 结构
```
helm/
├── Chart.yaml
├── values.yaml
├── values-prod.yaml
├── values-staging.yaml
└── templates/
    ├── deployment.yaml
    ├── service.yaml
    ├── ingress.yaml
    ├── configmap.yaml
    └── secret.yaml
```

### 部署配置
```yaml
# values.yaml
replicaCount: 3

image:
  repository: bytebot/bytebot-ui
  tag: "latest"
  pullPolicy: IfNotPresent

service:
  type: ClusterIP
  port: 3000

ingress:
  enabled: true
  className: "nginx"
  annotations:
    cert-manager.io/cluster-issuer: "letsencrypt-prod"
  hosts:
    - host: bytebot.example.com
      paths:
        - path: /
          pathType: Prefix
  tls:
    - secretName: bytebot-tls
      hosts:
        - bytebot.example.com

resources:
  limits:
    cpu: 500m
    memory: 512Mi
  requests:
    cpu: 250m
    memory: 256Mi

autoscaling:
  enabled: true
  minReplicas: 2
  maxReplicas: 10
  targetCPUUtilizationPercentage: 70
  targetMemoryUtilizationPercentage: 80
```

## 环境管理

### 环境配置
- **开发环境**: 本地开发，使用 Docker Compose
- **测试环境**: 自动化测试，使用 Kubernetes
- **预生产环境**: 生产前验证，使用 Kubernetes
- **生产环境**: 正式运行，使用 Kubernetes + 高可用

