## 部署策略

### 蓝绿部署
```bash
# 蓝绿部署脚本
#!/bin/bash

# 当前版本 (蓝色)
CURRENT_VERSION="v1.0.0"
# 新版本 (绿色)
NEW_VERSION="v1.1.0"

# 部署新版本到绿色环境
kubectl apply -f k8s/green/

# 等待绿色环境就绪
kubectl wait --for=condition=available --timeout=300s deployment/bytebot-ui-green

# 切换流量到绿色环境
kubectl patch service bytebot-ui -p '{"spec":{"selector":{"version":"green"}}}'

# 验证新版本
curl -f http://bytebot.example.com/health

# 如果验证失败，回滚到蓝色环境
if [ $? -ne 0 ]; then
  kubectl patch service bytebot-ui -p '{"spec":{"selector":{"version":"blue"}}}'
  exit 1
fi

# 清理旧版本
kubectl delete deployment bytebot-ui-blue
```

### 金丝雀发布
```yaml
# 金丝雀发布配置
apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1
kind: Rollout
metadata:
  name: bytebot-ui
spec:
  replicas: 5
  strategy:
    canary:
      steps:
      - setWeight: 20
      - pause: {duration: 10m}
      - setWeight: 40
      - pause: {duration: 10m}
      - setWeight: 60
      - pause: {duration: 10m}
      - setWeight: 80
      - pause: {duration: 10m}
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: bytebot-ui
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: bytebot-ui
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: bytebot-ui
        image: bytebot/bytebot-ui:v1.1.0
        ports:
        - containerPort: 3000
```

## 监控和可观察性

### 指标收集
```yaml
# Prometheus 配置
apiVersion: v1
kind: ConfigMap
metadata:
  name: prometheus-config
data:
  prometheus.yml: |
    global:
      scrape_interval: 15s
    scrape_configs:
    - job_name: 'bytebot-ui'
      static_configs:
      - targets: ['bytebot-ui:3000']
      metrics_path: '/metrics'
      scrape_interval: 5s
```

### 日志收集
```yaml
# Fluentd 配置
apiVersion: v1
kind: ConfigMap
metadata:
  name: fluentd-config
data:
  fluent.conf: |
    <source>
      @type tail
      path /var/log/containers/*bytebot*.log
      pos_file /var/log/fluentd-containers.log.pos
      tag kubernetes.*
      format json
    </source>
    
    <match kubernetes.**>
      @type elasticsearch
      host elasticsearch.logging.svc.cluster.local
      port 9200
      index_name bytebot-logs
    </match>
```

### 告警规则
```yaml
# 告警规则
apiVersion: monitoring.coreos.com/v1
kind: PrometheusRule
metadata:
  name: bytebot-alerts
spec:
  groups:
  - name: bytebot.rules
    rules:
    - alert: HighErrorRate
      expr: rate(http_requests_total{status=~"5.."}[5m]) > 0.1
      for: 5m
      labels:
        severity: critical
      annotations:
        summary: "High error rate detected"
        description: "Error rate is {{ $value }} errors per second"
    
    - alert: HighMemoryUsage
      expr: (container_memory_usage_bytes / container_spec_memory_limit_bytes) > 0.8
      for: 5m
      labels:
        severity: warning
      annotations:
        summary: "High memory usage detected"
        description: "Memory usage is {{ $value }}% of limit"
```

